WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.033
-Guys, I'm very excited
about this.

00:00:02.033 --> 00:00:02.801
Next Tuesday, I have a new

00:00:02.801 --> 00:00:03.901
children's book coming out

00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:05.300
[ Cheering and applause ]
called...

00:00:09.234 --> 00:00:12.000
This is a goodie.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.100
Yeah.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.534
"More than Paris
and the Eiffel Tower?

00:00:15.534 --> 00:00:17.968
More than cats
with SUPER cat powers."

00:00:17.968 --> 00:00:19.501
[ Awws, laughter, and applause ]

00:00:19.501 --> 00:00:20.634
Anyway, it's -- Yeah.

00:00:20.634 --> 00:00:22.100
Don't cry yet, Higgins.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.133
[ Laughter ]
But it is a little bit
of a weeper.

00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:25.100
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:26.601
-Sweet.
-But, to celebrate,

00:00:26.601 --> 00:00:28.267
all next week,
we're going to be showcasing

00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:29.968
some very talented grandmas
on the show,

00:00:29.968 --> 00:00:31.434
[ Awws and applause ]
from all over the country.

00:00:31.434 --> 00:00:34.100
Musicians, dancers, comedians,
lots more.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:35.501
So look for that
every night next week.

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:36.434
It's going to be fun.

00:00:36.434 --> 00:00:37.501
Nana Week!

00:00:37.501 --> 00:00:39.100
[ Cheering and applause
continues ]

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:40.133
Nana.

